<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <title>E-Book 受け取り | Taro Essence</title>
    <meta name="description" content="E-book受け取りページ" />
    <style is:global>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Oxygen',
          'Ubuntu', 'Cantarell', 'Fira Sans', 'Droid Sans', 'Helvetica Neue',
          sans-serif;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        background: #000000;
        color: #fafafa;
        color-scheme: dark;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 560px;
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .cover {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .label {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: #ffffff;
        background: #172c1f;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .lead {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #a1a1aa;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .form-card {
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      /* 高さ 150px 以下だと Substack 側が誌名の見出しを非表示にする */
      .form {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 150px;
        border: none;
        background: transparent;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <img class="cover" src="/assets/resource/50rules.png" alt="50 Minimal Life Rules" width="1920" height="1080" />
      <p class="label">無料 E-Book</p>
      <h1>心とお金にゆとりを生む<br />50のミニマルライフルール</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        登録後すぐに、E-Book のリンクをメールでお届けします。
      </p>
      <div class="form-card">
        <iframe
          class="form"
          src="https://kentarokk.substack.com/embed"
          title="E-Book を受け取る"
          frameborder="0"
          scrolling="no"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
